Manage Confluent Cloud budget inference budgets.

Usage:
  confluent budget inference-budget [command]

Available Commands:
  create      Create a budget inference budget.
  delete      Delete one or more budget inference budgets.
  describe    Describe a budget inference budget.
  list        List budget inference budgets.
  update      Update an existing budget inference budget.

Global Flags:
  -h, --help            Show help for this command.
      --unsafe-trace    Equivalent to -vvvv, but also log HTTP requests and responses which might contain plaintext secrets.
  -v, --verbose count   Increase verbosity (-v for warn, -vv for info, -vvv for debug, -vvvv for trace).

Use "confluent budget inference-budget [command] --help" for more information about a command.
